isa salutarieltʻaysa samtʻavroytʻ ganvasazġvre da carvcere; georgi undoman epikoposman kʻalakʻisa otruysaman samtʻavroytʻ salutariaytʻ ganvasazġvre da carvcere; ioane cqalobitʻa ġmrtʻisaytʻa episkoposman kʻalakʻisa polwvitoysaman samtʻavroysagan salutariisa ganvasazġvre da carvcere; tʻeopʻilaktos episkoposman pʻitwaysa samtʻavroysaman ganvasazġvre da carvcere; ioane diakonman kotwaion kʻalakʻisaman aġmavsebelman adgilsa cmidisa episkoposisa čʻuenisasa ganvasazġvre da carvcere; kostantinos undoman episkoposman kʻalakʻisa varitoysaman samtʻavroysagan lwkaoneltʻaysa ganvasazġvre da carvcere; evstatʻi uġirsman episkoposman kʻalakʻisa aneenandoysaman samtʻavroytʻ lwaonisaytʻ ganvasazġvre da carvcere; konon uġirsman episkoposman kʻalakʻisa easadonisaman samtʻavroysagan lukaonisa ganvasazġvre da carvcere; tʻeodosi undoman episkoposman verinoeltʻa kʻalakʻisaman samtʻavroytʻ lukaonisaytʻ ganvasazġvre da carvcere; longinos undoman episkoposman mistianoeltʻa kʻalakʻisaman samtʻavroytʻ lukaonosaytʻ ganvasazġvre da carvcere.
